"publishers":["Taylor & Francis Group"],"source_records":["bwb:9781351295451"],"title":"Turning Toward Technology","subtitle":"A Glimpse into the Asian Paradigm","full_title":"Turning Toward Technology A Glimpse into the Asian Paradigm","works":[{"key":"/works/OL20469454W"}],"key":"/books/OL54014011M","latest_revision":1,"revision":1,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2024-09-18T02:39:25.378485"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2024-09-18T02:39:25.378485"}}},"ISBN:9781351295482":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781351295482","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL44079119M/Turning_Toward_Technology","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL44079119M/Turning_Toward_Technology","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"publish_date":"2017","publish_country":"enk","languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7756784A","name":"Alessandro Tomasi"}],"oclc_numbers":["1004365936"],"lc_classifications":["T14 .T663 2017"],"dewey_decimal_class":["601"],"edition_name":"First edition.","description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"\"We live in an age when the dominant technologically utilitarian worldview is undergoing a transformation. To increase our awareness of this change, Turning Toward Technology introduces readers to the possibility of an alternative technological worldview by examining foundational concepts to Asian thought. The early Eastern philosophical treatment of technology was not ethical, but ontological, exhibiting sensitivity to how human existence was defined and determined in its relation to technology and to reality as a whole. Within the Eastern cultural orientation, technological development was guided by a singular aesthetic sensibility to the useful, the good, the beautiful, the true, and the holy. Instead of controlling the shape of future technology by systems of rational management, George Teschner and Alessandro Tomasi recommend a view of technology that arises from questioning fundamental assumptions within Western culture about knowledge, reality, and human nature. Turning Toward Technology aims to stimulate awareness of an alternative technological paradigm, and thus a different mode of social action that can establish an optimistic future for global civilization.\"--Provided by publisher."},"table_of_contents":[{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Chapter Introduction: Turning Toward  -- George Teschner Alessandro Tomasi","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"chapter 1 The Western Technological Paradigm  -- George Teschner Alessandro Tomasi","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"chapter 2 Cook Ting Uses a Bladeless Knife  -- George Teschner Alessandro Tomasi","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"chapter 3 Bow and Arrow without the Archer  -- George Teschner Alessandro Tomasi","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"chapter 4 The Lucky Leader  -- George Teschner Alessandro Tomasi","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"chapter 5 Śūnyatā as Technological Intimacy  -- George Teschner Alessandro Tomasi","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"chapter Conclusion -- George Teschner Alessandro Tomasi.","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}}],"links":[{"url":"http://www.columbia.edu/cgi-bin/cul/resolve?clio14728097","title":"Taylor & Francis eBooks"}],"subjects":["Criticism, interpretation","Technology","Philosophy","Moral and ethical aspects","Taoism","Confucianism","Buddhism","Technologie","Philosophie","Aspect moral","Taoïsme","Confucianisme","Bouddhisme","Bhagavadgītā"],"subject_places":["Asia","Asie"],"title":"Turning Toward Technology","subtitle":"a Glimpse into the Asian Paradigm","by_statement":"Alessandro Tomasi","publishers":["Taylor and Francis"],"publish_places":["London"],"isbn_13":["9781351295482"],"isbn_10":["1